This chapter shares only battle, Combat, enlist, heal, challenge, fight, recalculate, respond and encounter.

Use the sound, cries, learnsets and encounters chapters.

A battle has a starter (text), an original (text), a species (text), an opponent (text), a message (text), a move one (text), a move two (text), a move three (text), a move four (text), an outcome (text), a foe (text), a level (number), an enemy level (number), a health (number), a maximum health (number), an enemy health (number), an enemy maximum health (number), a choice (number), a pp one (number), a pp two (number), a pp three (number), a pp four (number), a base speed (number), an enemy base speed (number), an active (number), an experience (number), an attack (number), a defense (number), a special (number), a speed (number), an enemy attack (number), an enemy defense (number), an enemy special (number), an enemy speed (number), a base experience (number), a turn (number), a seed (number), a bide (number), a stored damage (number), a enemy status (text), a full heals (number), an accuracy stage (number), a seeded (number), an attack stage (number), an enemy attack stage (number), a defense stage (number), an enemy defense stage (number), a second (number).
There is a battle called Combat whose starter is "", whose original is "", whose species is "", whose opponent is "", whose message is "", whose move one is "", whose move two is "", whose move three is "", whose move four is "", whose outcome is "", whose foe is "", whose level is 5, whose enemy level is 5, whose health is 1, whose maximum health is 1, whose enemy health is 1, whose enemy maximum health is 1, whose choice is 1, whose pp one is 35, whose pp two is 40, whose pp three is 0, whose pp four is 0, whose base speed is 45, whose enemy base speed is 45, whose active is 0, whose experience is 0, whose attack is 1, whose defense is 1, whose special is 1, whose speed is 1, whose enemy attack is 1, whose enemy defense is 1, whose enemy special is 1, whose enemy speed is 1, whose base experience is 1, whose turn is 0, whose seed is 47, whose bide is 0, whose stored damage is 0, whose enemy status is "", whose full heals is 0, whose accuracy stage is 0, whose seeded is 0, whose attack stage is 0, whose enemy attack stage is 0, whose defense stage is 0, whose enemy defense stage is 0, and whose second is 0.

To work out the stat (number) from a base (number) at a level (number):
  Let the result be (((the base + 8) * 2 * the level / 100) rounded down to the nearest 1) + 5.
  The answer is the result.

To work out the health stat (number) from a base (number) at a level (number):
  Let the result be (((the base + 8) * 2 * the level / 100) rounded down to the nearest 1) + the level + 10.
  The answer is the result.

The base stats are health, attack, defense, special and speed, in that order:
