  "Weedle" from 7 has "Kakuna".
  "Kakuna" from 10 has "Beedrill".
  "Spearow" from 20 has "Fearow".

To recalculate:
  Let the evolution be the evolutions for Combat's starter at Combat's level.
  Set Combat's species to the evolution's species or else Combat's starter.
  Let the profile be the base stats for "Bulbasaur".
  If the move sets for Combat's starter is not nothing:
    Set the profile to the base stats for Combat's species.
  If the profile is not nothing:
    Set Combat's base speed to the profile's speed.
    Set Combat's maximum health to the health stat from the profile's health at Combat's level.
    Set Combat's attack to the stat from the profile's attack at Combat's level.
    Set Combat's defense to the stat from the profile's defense at Combat's level.
    Set Combat's special to the stat from the profile's special at Combat's level.
    Set Combat's speed to the stat from the profile's speed at Combat's level.
  Set Combat's move one to the first move for Combat's starter.
  Set Combat's move two to the second move for Combat's starter at Combat's level.
  Set Combat's move three to the third move for Combat's starter at Combat's level.
  Set Combat's move four to the fourth move for Combat's starter at Combat's level.

The move capacities are pp, in that order:
  "" has 0.
  "Growl" has 40.
  "String Shot" has 40.
  "Tail Whip" has 40.
  "Harden" has 40.
  "Leech Seed" has 10.
  "Vine Whip" has 10.
  "Ember" has 25.
